msgctxt "#32007"
msgid "This script creates a webdav server from your remote using rclone, it also updates the Kodi library automatically when new files are added to the remote. Add your rclone.conf file to the profile directory"
msgstr "此脚本使用rclone从您的远程存储创建webdav服务器，当远程存储中添加新文件时，它还会自动更新Kodi库。请将您的rclone.conf文件添加到配置文件目录"

